# Data Licence

## What this covers

The **database contents** of co-fe:

- Café records (names, locations, addresses, opening hours)
- Work-condition ratings and derived scores
- Community notes and contributions

It does **not** cover the source code, which is licensed under MIT — see the LICENSE file.

